                <note rend="inline" type="source">511.3B1/9: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Commission to Negotiate
                            Peace to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Paris</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-10-25T23:00:00+00:00"><hi rendition="#italic">October 25,
                                1919—11 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 11:28
                    p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>4824. Your 3469, October 17th, 5 p.m. Commission shares Department’s views as to
                    nature and [effect of] protocol to Arms Traffic Convention, and informal
                    discussion shows that Principal Allied and Associated Powers understand protocol
                    in same sense. Polk.</p>
                <closer><hi rendition="#small-caps">American Mission</hi></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
